### 逐处错误标注
1. It was widely acknowledged → It is widely acknowledged；这是通用客观观点，用一般现在时
2. students' many factors → students；表达冗余，原句语义不通，直接删去多余部分
3. good learning habit → good learning habits；habit 是可数名词，此处用复数
4. whthin → within（拼写错误）
5. pre-study → preview；四级写作标准词：预习 preview
6. which be capable to improve → which helps them improve；which 指代整件事，谓语用单数；be capable of doing 才是正确搭配
7. approches → approaches（拼写错误）
8. student → students；泛指学生，用复数
9. practical health → physical health；“身体健康” 固定表达 physical health，practical 表示 “实际的” 用词错误
10. Correct position → Proper sitting postures；position 表达生硬，坐姿是 sitting posture
11. healthy problems → health problems；health 作定语修饰 problems，healthy 是形容词
12. pratical → physical（拼写 + 用词错误）
	

### 修正版
	It is widely acknowledged that developing good learning habits exerts a profound influence on students. Students are supposed to develop good learning habits within their 
ability.
	For one thing, developing good learning habits can obviously boost students' academic performance. Once they form good learning habits, they will preview and review 
