and regular sleep can prevent students from many health problems.
	From my perspective, students should develop good learning habits. Only in this way can they improve their academic performance and physical health.


### 优化完整版
	It is widely acknowledged that developing good learning habits exerts a profound influence on students’ growth. It is advisable for students to form such habits step by step.
	For one thing, good learning habits greatly promote academic progress. With the habit of previewing new lessons and reviewing learned knowledge on schedule, students can 
absorb knowledge more efficiently. For another, these habits are good for students’ physical condition. Regular study plans and proper sitting postures help them avoid eye
strain and other health troubles.
	From my perspective, it is necessary for students to cultivate good learning habits. Only in this way can they achieve steady progress in study and keep healthy at the same 
time.

